# Online Examination System

A Java Swing GUI desktop application that allows students to take timed multiple-choice exams with instant evaluation and detailed scoring breakdowns.

## Features

- **User Authentication**: Secure login interface for registered users.
- **Profile Management**: Option to update display name and password before starting the exam.
- **Interactive MCQ Engine**: Displays questions one at a time using radio buttons for option selection.
- **Question Navigation**: Previous and Next controls to switch between questions easily.
- **Live Countdown Timer**: 30-minute timer using `javax.swing.Timer` that auto-submits the exam when time runs out.
- **Session Protection**: Exit confirmation dialogs to prevent accidental closing during active exams.
- **Result & Breakdown**: Instant evaluation showing final score, time spent, and a complete question-by-question breakdown.

## Tech Stack

- **Language**: Java
- **GUI Framework**: Java Swing & AWT (`CardLayout`, `JRadioButton`, `javax.swing.Timer`)
